  "paradigm_pack_notes": "Tezcatlipoca's Feral Link skill, Raging Torrent, is the only means of applying the Debrave and Defaith status effects. It also applies the Provoke status, and all three of the status effects Serah and Noel cannot inflict with spells: Fog, Pain, and Curse.\n\nTezcatlipoca is the only creature with the Auto-Tetradefense passive ability available for infusion (Grand Behemoth has it, but it is red-locked). Auto-Tetradefense casts Protect, Shell, Veil, and Vigilance at the start of combat. The passive abilities Resist Magic +36% and Resist Physical +36% are prized enough by players that they are included in a large percentage of the innumerable creature'builds' posted online, and Tezcatlipoca has both of them without infusion.\n\nAuto-Tetradefense, along with Resist Elements +30% and Auto-Haste, are the only three abilities with the highest (ninth) rank, so they can never be replaced by other abilities.\n\nIt requires 66 grade three Biological (Orb) monster materials to advance to level 20; 155 grade four Essences to maximum level of 60.",
